{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108320","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710832001:0":{"text":"끝난 건가요...?","source_cn":"结束了吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9229709ECA3EE99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1710832001":{"text":"끝난 건가요...?","source_cn":"结束了吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9229709ECA3EE99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710832002:1":{"text":"멀린 님, 저도 이제 이 정도는 거뜬해요.","source_cn":"梅林大人，我现在已经可以做到这些了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DC69D78EA3A5F8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님, 저도 이제 이 정도는 거뜬해요.","female":"멀린 님, 저도 이제 이 정도는 거뜬해요.","variant_male_record_index":"227388","variant_female_record_index":"227389","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710832003:0":{"text":"제가 돕게 해주세요.","source_cn":"请让我来协助您。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD40C9D155B641A98","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제가 돕게 해주세요.","female":"제가 돕게 해주세요.","variant_male_record_index":"227390","variant_female_record_index":"227391","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710832004:0":{"text":"다만, 그 불경한 자... 딜그레이가 달아났군.","source_cn":"除此之外，那个亵渎者，迪尔格雷，他逃脱了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4781B7941C7C3B62","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다만, 그 불경한 자... 딜그레이가 달아났군.","femal